{"id":"5195478e7a49fc18","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable.md","title":"QML Provability Has No Recursive Axiomatization","display":"cor-qml-not-axiomatizable — QML Provability Has No Recursive Axiomatization","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable","aliases":["89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable"],"display":"cor-qml-not-axiomatizable — QML Provability Has No Recursive Axiomatization","depends_on":["[[89-thm-qml-complexity]]","[[89-df-relative-completeness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-qml-not-axiomatizable — QML Provability Has No Recursive Axiomatization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e0f03a34c592870\" href=\"?note=4e0f03a34c592870\" title=\"89-thm-qml-complexity\">89-thm-qml-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ced779f9ea9b74df\" href=\"?note=ced779f9ea9b74df\" title=\"89-df-relative-completeness\">89-df-relative-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有效证明演算具有可枚举公理及可判定有限证明检查。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>采用算术层次的严格性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 是标准算术真值集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是 QML 总可证、总为真码集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n\\)</span> 为无 oracle 算术层次。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}qml\\text{-}not\\text{-}axiomatizable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q\\notin\\Sigma^0_1,\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\notin\\Sigma^0_n\\cup\\Pi^0_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}qml\\text{-}not\\text{-}axiomatizable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q\\notin\\Sigma^0_1,\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\notin\\Sigma^0_n\\cup\\Pi^0_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 220,232–239；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_2\">\\(\\Pi^0_2\\)</span> 完全集若可枚举，则所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_2\">\\(\\Pi^0_2\\)</span> 集合可枚举，与层次严格性矛盾；因此没有题设意义的有效公理演算恰好产生全部总可证 QML 句子。总为真集合的非算术性还可由原书 Theorem 1 的算术真值有效归约直接得出，而不只是从一个 oracle 上界推断。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-qml-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"4e0f03a34c592870","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-qml-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-relative-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"ced779f9ea9b74df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-relative-completeness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}qml\\text{-}not\\text{-}axiomatizable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AP}_Q\\notin\\Sigma^0_1,\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\notin\\Sigma^0_n\\cup\\Pi^0_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_2","display":false}],"bytes":1446,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]] → [[89-df-open-provability-formula]] → [[89-df-qml-realization]] → [[89-df-qml-validity-sets]] → [[89-df-relative-completeness]] → [[89-thm-qml-complexity]] → [[89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable]]"}],"outgoing":["4e0f03a34c592870","ced779f9ea9b74df"]}